      ],
      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/place/Demopolis",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1944 the Alabama Cattlemen’s Association was founded in Demopolis, reflecting the region’s long‑standing agricultural heritage.",
